/target
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock
/.idea
/results
*.swp
.luarc.json

# prova run state: locks, run records, and report custody copies.
# `.prova/baselines/` and `.prova/packages/` ARE tracked — they are the bar and
# the shared fixtures, not run output.
/.prova/var
# Run timings are machine-dependent and no ratchet consults them; `--update-baseline`
# writes this set anyway, so keep it out of the tree rather than churning it per host.
/.prova/baselines/timings.json

# Coverage strays. An instrumented process whose LLVM_PROFILE_FILE is lost falls
# back to `default_<sig>_0_<pid>.profraw` in its own cwd — LLVM's default, not a
# path anything here controls. The coverage conduct sweeps them, but a stray must
# never be able to reach history: 1,385 of them were staged once before this line.
*.profraw
